# Block contract

Follow [docs/blockstudio-blocks.md](docs/blockstudio-blocks.md). `block.json` is the source of truth. Update the PHP template, the shared CSS, the Astro component, the contract, and `BlockRenderer.astro` together, then run `pnpm generate`.

Do not hand-edit `astro/src/generated/blocks.ts`. Do not add ACF. Use `register_post_meta` with `show_in_rest` for post meta.
